OL,3,GNEWSAThe unlikely vineyard inside a
OL,4,ALondon railway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are few places you would expect
OL,7,Fto stumble across a vineyard in inner
OL,8,FLondon and a sunny railway embankment
OL,9,Fin south London is probably not high on
OL,10,Fthe list.
OL,12,FYet just metres from the tracks at
OL,13,FDenmark Hill station, a small group of
OL,14,Fvolunteers is growing grapes to turn
OL,15,Finto wine.
OL,17,FThe aptly named Chateau Denmark Hill
OL,18,FStation vineyard is the work of
OL,19,FCamberwell Society members Nick Mair
OL,20,Fand Tony Coleman, who saw a neglected
OL,21,Fpatch of land as a place with the
OL,22,Fpotential for making wine.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
