OL,3,GNEWSAThe unlikely vineyard inside a
OL,4,ALondon railway station
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We had this beautiful, south-facing
OL,7,Fslope covered in brambles, bindweed and
OL,8,Fstuff like that," says Tony. "And Nick
OL,9,Fsaid 'this could be a vineyard'. And we
OL,10,Fthought, 'wow, wouldn't that be an
OL,11,Famazing thing to do?'"
